    <bpmn:process id="W_W3923" name="W3923. Supply-Chain Design &amp; Network/Inventory Strategy Input" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic cycle; constraint patterns from S&amp;OP
Frequency: Quarterly + on strategic trigger
Volume: Network/design input from S&amp;OP learning
Owner: S&amp;OP / Supply Chain Strategy
Participants: S&amp;OP Lead, Supply Chain Strategy, Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), DC (links to VS-04), Real Estate/Network (links to VS-20/VS-97), Sourcing (links to VS-122), Finance (links to VS-40/VS-105), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3923 — Supply-Chain Design &amp; Network/Inventory Strategy Input</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3923_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3923_Lane1" name="S&amp;OP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3923_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3923_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3923_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3923_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3923_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3923_Start3" name="Strategic cycle; constraint patterns from S&amp;OP">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3923_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3923_Task4" name="S&amp;OP/Supply-Chain-Strategy feed recurring S&amp;OP constraints into network/design…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP/Supply-Chain-Strategy feed recurring S&amp;OP constraints into network/design decisions: DC capacity expansion (links to VS-04/VS-20), new DC for growth regions (links to profile §3.2/VS-20), import-flow consolidation (links to VS-122/VS-110), vendor-base restructuring (links to VS-03/VS-122), and inventory-pooling/cross-dock (links to VS-04)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Supply Chain Strategy
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3923_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3923_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3923_Task5" name="S&amp;OP/Real-Estate/Finance evaluate network-capex options (new DC, store growth…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP/Real-Estate/Finance evaluate network-capex options (new DC, store growth links to VS-37/VS-20, transport fleet links to VS-06/VS-110) with ROI and capacity scenarios (links to VS-40/VS-112), informed by S&amp;OP demand/supply scenarios (links to W3917)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Real Estate / Finance
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3923_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3923_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3923_Task6" name="S&amp;OP feed insights into corporate strategy (links to VS-33) and the multi-year…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP feed insights into corporate strategy (links to VS-33) and the multi-year plan, and track design-decision impact on S&amp;OP KPIs (service, turn, cost)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Strategy
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3923_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3923_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3923_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3923_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3923_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-612 (ensure controlled execution — IBP Financial Integration, Performance &amp; Continuous Improvement (PA-127.3).) | - operational: quarterly design input; operational: Finance partnership (links to VS-40)
Owner: S&amp;OP / Supply Chain Strategy</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
