    <bpmn:process id="W_W3924" name="W3924. Working-Capital &amp; Inventory Investment Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Plan publication (W3920); treasury/SCF cycle
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Inventory investment ~PHP multi-billion; working-capital plan
Owner: S&amp;OP / Finance / Treasury
Participants: S&amp;OP Lead, Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18), SCF (links to VS-105), Supply (links to VS-02), Sourcing (links to VS-122/VS-105), Merchandising (links to VS-101)
Source: workflow W3924 — Working-Capital &amp; Inventory Investment Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3924_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3924_Lane1" name="S&amp;OP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3924_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3924_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3924_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3924_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3924_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3924_Start3" name="Plan publication (W3920); treasury/SCF cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3924_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3924_Task4" name="S&amp;OP/Finance project the inventory-investment requirement from the plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP/Finance project the inventory-investment requirement from the plan (purchase commitments, in-transit, on-hand by category/season), and the resulting cash-conversion-cycle and working-capital need
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Finance / Supply
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead / FP&amp;A
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3924_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3924_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3924_Task5" name="S&amp;OP/Treasury/SCF align financing for the inventory plan: supplier terms (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP/Treasury/SCF align financing for the inventory plan: supplier terms (links to VS-03/VS-15), SCF/reverse-factoring/dynamic-discounting (links to VS-105), import LC/TT (links to VS-18/VS-122), and seasonal pre-build financing
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Treasury / SCF
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead / Treasurer
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3924_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3924_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3924_Task6" name="S&amp;OP/Finance optimize the inventory investment vs service/turn trade-off (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP/Finance optimize the inventory investment vs service/turn trade-off (links to W3914), and flag working-capital pressure to exec S&amp;OP (links to W3919) for plan adjustment
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP / Finance
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3924_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3924_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3924_End7" name="Complete">
