Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3926_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3926_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
