    <bpmn:process id="W_W3928" name="W3928. S&amp;OP Maturity Assessment &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; maturity cycle
Frequency: Annual + quarterly improvement
Volume: 1 maturity assessment/yr
Owner: S&amp;OP Lead / COO
Participants: S&amp;OP Lead, COO, Functions (links to VS-01/VS-02/VS-14/VS-17.4/VS-06/VS-122), Strategy (links to VS-33), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Innovation (links to VS-30)
Source: workflow W3928 — S&amp;OP Maturity Assessment &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3928_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3928_Lane1" name="S&amp;OP Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3928_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3928_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3928_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3928_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3928_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3928_Start3" name="Annual review; maturity cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3928_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3928_Task4" name="S&amp;OP Lead/COO run the annual S&amp;OP maturity assessment (process, people, data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP Lead/COO run the annual S&amp;OP maturity assessment (process, people, data, tooling, governance — vs a maturity model), benchmark accuracy/service/turn vs profile targets (§12.3) and retail benchmarks, and identify gaps
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead / COO / Insights
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3928_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3928_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3928_Task5" name="S&amp;OP Lead develop the maturity-improvement roadmap (process discipline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP Lead develop the maturity-improvement roadmap (process discipline, forecast capability links to W3911, IBP financial integration links to W3921, tooling upgrade links to W3927, talent links to VS-19.4), and prioritize with exec sponsorship
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3928_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3928_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3928_Task6" name="S&amp;OP Lead execute quarterly improvement actions, track maturity progression…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP Lead execute quarterly improvement actions, track maturity progression, and report to the executive committee (links to VS-33/VS-36)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead / COO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3928_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3928_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3928_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3928_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3928_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-612 (ensure controlled execution — IBP Financial Integration, Performance &amp; Continuous Improvement (PA-127.3).) | - operational: annual assessment and exec sponsorship; operational: balanced roadmap
Owner: S&amp;OP Lead / COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
